<div class="instructions experiment-design">
  <p>Describe the design of your experiment in detail, making sure to include all the information needed to evaluate the design and for repeatability. We suggest including information on all of the following <strong>that apply to your type of experiment</strong>:</p>

  <ul>
    <li>biological and technical replication</li>
    <li>randomization and blocking</li>
    <li>treatments and controls</li>
    <li>specific assay techniques used</li>
    <li>sample or measurement collection considerations</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Make sure to not only state specific design/techniques but also to fully describe why these choices were made and how they apply to your specific experiment. Also, remember that the above list is not meant to be exhaustive.</p>
</div>
